### 3️⃣ 🧰 Troubleshooting & Fixes
During setup, I encountered several issues that deepened my understanding of SAML authentication:

| Issue | Root Cause | Resolution |
|--------|-------------|-------------|
| **400 Error from Google** | ACS URL mismatch | Matched the ACS URL in Google Workspace & `settings.json` |
| **Missing `settings.json`** | File not found error | Created file manually with correct SAML JSON schema |
| **Certificate Load Error** | Flask couldn’t locate `cert.pem` | Moved certs to root & updated Flask route paths |
| **Entity ID Mismatch** | Case sensitivity (L vs l) | Standardized all SAML Entity IDs |

